OL,3,ARAF Fairford incident 'clearly
OL,4,Ainvolves' foreign actor, says US
OL,5,Asecretary of state
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS Secretary of State Marco Rubio has
OL,8,Fsaid the weekend incident at RAF
OL,9,FFairford "clearly involves the hands of
OL,10,Fa foreign actor"
OL,12,FSpeaking to US media, he did not give
OL,13,Ffurther details but thanked UK
OL,14,Fauthorities for being "cooperative" and
OL,15,F"helpful"
OL,17,FOn Monday, five men arrested on
OL,18,Fsuspicion of terror offences near the
OL,19,Fbase were released on bail
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
