OL,3,ARAF Fairford incident 'clearly
OL,4,Ainvolves' foreign actor, says US
OL,5,Asecretary of state
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe men - all UK nationals in their 20s
OL,8,Fwho live in London - had been arrested
OL,9,Funder the Explosives Act and on
OL,10,Fsuspicion of preparing a terrorist act
OL,12,FAssistant Commissioner Laurence Taylor,
OL,13,Fthe head of UK counter terrorism
OL,14,Fpolicing, said police were continuing
OL,15,Fto investigate
OL,17,FTaylor also said officers were
OL,18,Fconsidering numerous angles, including
OL,19,Fif proxies working on behalf of a
OL,20,Fforeign state could've been involved.
OL,21,FThe Iranian embassy in the UK denies
OL,22,Fany involvement
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
