OL,4,Ainvolves' foreign actor, says US
OL,5,Asecretary of state
OL,6,
OL,7,FA large cordon remains in place near
OL,8,Fthe base and 85 households - evacuated
OL,9,Fon Sunday - have now been told by
OL,10,FGloucestershire Police they can return
OL,11,Fhome
